  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till oberoende media i MENA regionen f&#xf6;r att underst&#xf6;dja alternativa r&#xf6;ster och ansvarsutkr&#xe4;vande</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to independent media organisations in the MENA region to promote alternative voices and accountability</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The strategic ambition/goal of IMS regional strategy 2025-2028 is to:

&quot;By the end of 2028, targeted independent media ecosystems in MENA will be strengthened and become more resilient, providing a diverse audience with access to reliable public interest content and fostering inclusive public debate that holds those in power to account.&quot;

The strategic ambition is supported by three strategic outcome areas that set the direction of IMS approach and programme priorities: 

- Strategic outcome area 1: Public interest content, business viability.
- Strategic outcome area 2: The safety and protection of journalists, content producers and media.
- Strategic outcome area 3: Policy, laws, regulations and public interest infrastructure.</narrative>
  </description>
